---
{
  title: "clamp"
}
---
### NAME

    clamp() - Ensures a value is within a specified range.

### SYNOPSIS

    float clamp( float val, float min, float max );

### DESCRIPTION

    Ensures a value is within a specified range.

### PARAMETERS

    min  (float)
         The minimum value.

    max  (float)
         The maximum value.

    val  (float)
         The value to check.

### RETURN VALUES

    (float) The value, constrained within the range of `min` to `max`.
